WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.144
You're running a marathon. And your friends want to cheer you on.

00:03.550 --> 00:05.641
But who stands where? And who brings what?

00:06.250 --> 00:08.362
Sideline organizes your cheer squad.

00:08.900 --> 00:10.649
Friends show where they'll be on the course,

00:11.700 --> 00:12.831
and what they're bringing.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.179
On race day, they see you coming, live... and they're ready for you.

00:17.700 --> 00:19.950
Every cheer, every photo, shared with the squad.

00:19.950 --> 00:22.467
Sideline. Get your people to the right kilometre.
